WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.503
"Happy Birthday, Bumble!" Feather said.

2
00:00:08.504 --> 00:00:12.383
"I baked a cake.

3
00:00:12.384 --> 00:00:14.922
Later we'll have a party!"

4
00:00:14.923 --> 00:00:19.066
"Thanks, Feather," Bumble said.

5
00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:22.789
Bumble turned back to his fairy catalog.

6
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:27.747
"What do I want for my birthday?" he thought.

7
00:00:27.748 --> 00:00:30.615
He turned the page.

8
00:00:30.616 --> 00:00:34.197
There was a new Super Fairy book.

9
00:00:34.198 --> 00:00:39.035
"I wish I was like Super Fairy," he thought.

10
00:00:39.036 --> 00:00:43.325
"Super Fairy never makes mistakes."

11
00:00:43.326 --> 00:00:47.820
Suddenly the fairies heard trumpets.

12
00:00:47.821 --> 00:00:54.545
Bumble dropped the catalog.

13
00:00:54.546 --> 00:00:55.850
Whoosh!

14
00:00:55.851 --> 00:01:01.464
A carriage landed in Fairy Grove.

15
00:01:01.465 --> 00:01:08.867
Hob gulped. "The Fairy Queen is here!"

16
00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:15.455
The fairies bowed as the Queen stepped out.

17
00:01:15.456 --> 00:01:18.947
"It's a new season," she said.

18
00:01:18.948 --> 00:01:22.258
"So you must pass a new test."

19
00:01:22.259 --> 00:01:25.287
"Uh-oh," Bumble thought.

20
00:01:25.288 --> 00:01:29.664
"I'll probably make lots of mistakes."

21
00:01:29.665 --> 00:01:33.653
"What's the reward this time?" Sprite asked.

22
00:01:33.654 --> 00:01:39.328
"A feast at my palace, of course," the Queen said.

23
00:01:39.329 --> 00:01:44.229
Feather's eyes lit up. "What's the test?"

24
00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:49.066
"This test is about speed," the Fairy Queen said.

25
00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:55.296
"You must grant a birthday wish very, very fast."

26
00:01:55.297 --> 00:02:00.442
"We'll get the reward for sure!" Sprite said.

27
00:02:00.443 --> 00:02:04.582
"Will we fly in your carriage?" Feather asked.

28
00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:07.928
"No," the Fairy Queen said.

29
00:02:07.929 --> 00:02:13.514
"I want to see how fast you can fly."

30
00:02:13.515 --> 00:02:16.697
Bumble held up his powder pouch.

31
00:02:16.698 --> 00:02:19.792
"Can we refill these first?"

32
00:02:19.793 --> 00:02:23.771
"Yes," the Queen said.

33
00:02:23.772 --> 00:02:32.589
The fairies hurried to the powder bins.

34
00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:37.974
Bumble took some powder.

35
00:02:37.975 --> 00:02:50.431
Then he bumped into a tree branch. "Aah!"

36
00:02:50.432 --> 00:03:00.729
Powder spilled everywhere!

37
00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:07.657
Bumble's face turned red. "Sorry, Your Majesty!"

38
00:03:07.658 --> 00:03:17.208
The Queen frowned. "You're very clumsy, Bumble."

39
00:03:17.209 --> 00:03:23.932
Just then Feather looked up. "Wish smoke!"

40
00:03:23.933 --> 00:03:29.879
Bumble watched the smoke drift toward them.

41
00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:32.587
Hob read the wish aloud.

42
00:03:32.588 --> 00:03:37.723
"A boy named Nick wants a new watch."

43
00:03:37.724 --> 00:03:42.264
"We can pass this test!" Bumble whispered to himself.

44
00:03:42.265 --> 00:03:52.061
"I won't make mistakes—just like Super Fairy."

